    <mxCell id="t_149" value="• OAuth M2M as its own SP&lt;br&gt;• rule ACCEPTED or refused&lt;br&gt;  in the subscribe call&lt;br&gt;• waits for the hub's ACTIVE&lt;br&gt;• consumes only its own hub&lt;br&gt;• no Azure secret in the app&lt;br&gt;• exits non-zero, never silent" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B5E20;" vertex="1" parent="c_142">
